[
  {"id":"default-01","text":"真挚！与热诚！","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-02","text":"今天从这里开始。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-03","text":"正在活着。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-04","text":"向着想去的地方。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-05","text":"别浪费这个晴天。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-06","text":"先把眼前这一件做好。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-07","text":"给今天留下一点痕迹。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-08","text":"好好吃饭，也好好前进。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-09","text":"想做的事，现在就开始。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-10","text":"把注意力交给真正重要的事。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-11","text":"今天也要过得具体。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-12","text":"累了就休息，然后再走。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-13","text":"先生活，再抵达。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-14","text":"去做会让自己骄傲的事。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-15","text":"今天值得认真对待。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-16","text":"留一点力气给喜欢的事。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-17","text":"此刻，就是生活本身。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-18","text":"做完一件，再去下一件。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-19","text":"别急，方向还在。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"},
  {"id":"default-20","text":"今天也有今天的光。","createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00Z"}
